---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Terms of service"
  description="What HotNow provides, how to use your account, and how to reach us."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap terms">
      <h1>Terms of service</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: October 29, 2026</p>

      <p>
        HotNow sends you researched companies that may need what you sell, with contacts and sources.
      </p>

      <h2>What you get</h2>
      <p>These are researched leads. We do our best.</p>
      <p>We do not promise results. A company on a lead may not want to buy.</p>

      <h2>Your account</h2>
      <p>Keep your login safe.</p>
      <p>Use HotNow in a lawful way. Do not misuse the service. Do not scrape it.</p>

      <h2>Contacting leads</h2>
      <p>You are responsible for how you contact leads.</p>
      <p>Follow the outreach and anti-spam laws that apply to you.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may change or stop the service.</p>
      <p>When these terms change, we will update this page and the date above.</p>

      <h2>Misuse</h2>
      <p>We may suspend accounts that misuse the service.</p>

      <h2>The service</h2>
      <p>The service is provided as is.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:ankit@redstonegtm.com">ankit@redstonegtm.com</a> if you have a question about these
        terms.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .terms {
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .terms .updated {
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .terms h2 {
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .terms p {
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--soft);
  }

  .terms a {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
  }
</style>
